  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KOLENTE AGRICULTURAL DEVELOPMENT PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJ. INVOLVES THE AGRICULTURAL DEVELOPMENT OF 1,000 HA. OF WHICH 100 HA. WILL BE PUT UNDER IRRIGATION .IT WILL BE POSSIBLE TO PRACTISS ANNUAL DOUBLE CROPPING OF MAIZE ON 300 HA, RAINFED RICE ON 200 HA, GROWNDNUTS ON 100 HA.CASSAVA ON 300 HA, AND VEGETABLES ON 100 HA. IRRIGATED LAND WILL CONCERN 100 MODERN FARMERS FAMILIES HAVING ALREADY SOUND KNOWLEDGE IN THE FIEL OF AGRICULTURE.</narrative>
  </description>
